WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.181
David Lametti.

00:00:01.181 --> 00:00:04.113
Former Minister of Justice and Attorney General.

00:00:04.113 --> 00:00:08.465
Architect of Bill C-7 which expanded MAID to people who are not dying.

00:00:08.465 --> 00:00:15.147
He removed the requirement that death be reasonably foreseeable and eliminated the 10-day reflection period for Track 1 patients.
